---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PreorderButton from '../../components/PreorderButton.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="A Bond of Blood and Magick"
  description="A Bond of Blood and Magick — Book One of the series by Scott A. Lund. Releasing late Q4 2026."
>

  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="bg-navy text-cream px-6 py-16 md:py-20 text-center">
    <p class="text-cream-dark tracking-widest uppercase text-xs mb-4">Book One</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl">A Bond of Blood and Magick</h1>
    <p class="font-sans text-cream/60 mt-4 text-sm tracking-wide">by Scott A. Lund</p>
    <div class="mt-8">
      <PreorderButton />
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- Book detail -->
  <section class="bg-cream px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 md:gap-16 items-center md:items-start">

      <!-- Cover -->
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
        <img
          src="/images/a-bond-of-blood-and-magick-book-cover.png"
          alt="A Bond of Blood and Magick — Book One cover"
          class="w-48 md:w-64 shadow-xl rounded-sm"
        />

        <!-- Preorder buttons — hidden until links are ready
             To show: remove `hidden`, replace # with real retailer links -->
        <div class="hidden flex-col gap-3 w-full max-w-xs mt-2">
          <a href="#" class="block text-center bg-burgundy hover:bg-burgundy-light text-cream font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs px-6 py-3 transition-colors">
            Preorder on Amazon
          </a>
          <a href="#" class="block text-center border border-navy text-navy hover:bg-navy hover:text-cream font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs px-6 py-3 transition-colors">
            Barnes &amp; Noble
          </a>
          <a href="#" class="block text-center border border-navy text-navy hover:bg-navy hover:text-cream font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs px-6 py-3 transition-colors">
            Bookshop.org
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Details -->
      <div class="flex-1">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center md:justify-start gap-4 mb-8 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">
          <span class="bg-burgundy/10 text-burgundy px-3 py-1">YA Fantasy</span>
          <span class="bg-navy/10 text-navy px-3 py-1">Book One</span>
          <span class="bg-navy/10 text-navy px-3 py-1">Releasing Q4 2026</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-navy mb-6 text-center md:text-left">About the Book</h2>

        <div class="text-center md:text-left mb-8">
          <PreorderButton />
        </div>

        <div class="font-sans text-navy/70 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
            In a land ruled by three brother kings, a fragile peace holds sway. It is all their
            children have known. But when twelve-year-old Trudy, her younger sister Judy, and
            their cousins befriend the Watcher, the treaty with the North—secured years before
            by their grandfather, the Silverback King—is already beginning to fray.
          </p>
          <p>
            Whispers of ancient magick linger in the air across the kingdom of Boondoggle, amidst
            legends of the last dragon and the young man who gained her trust. Sorcerers,
            luchorpáin, and other creatures thrive in a mystical grove hidden deep within the
            heart of the realm. But as Trudy and her cousins discover the mystical wonders of
            their own land, the threat of war continues to grow.
          </p>
          <p>
            With their home and countless creatures in danger, the kings must call on old
            alliances—little knowing that some of their own children wield potential powers long
            thought lost. Can a bond of blood and magick overcome ancient enmities and a
            devastating war, or will the land of Boondoggle faulter?
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- Back to books -->
  <section class="bg-cream-dark px-6 py-12 text-center">
    <a
      href="/books"
      class="inline-block border border-navy text-navy hover:bg-navy hover:text-cream font-sans text-xs tracking-widest uppercase px-8 py-3 transition-colors"
    >
      &larr; All Books
    </a>
  </section>

</Layout>
